"""Approximate a response to decimal points and other formatting cues.

Periods after digits are positive, especially after zero, short integers,
and in recently decimal-looking text. Longer numbers, line-initial list
numbers, repeated dots in versions, fractions, list labels,
and year-like integers are weaker. Version prefixes and numbers inside
markup get a larger response.
