"""Approximate a sparse text-boundary signal.

End markers are negative, adjusted for the preceding punctuation. Line breaks
are increasingly negative after long runs without a break, especially the first
line of the supplied document. The colon of an initial literal `Title:` heading
is a much larger negative signal. Initial tokens get a rough character-shape
estimate; ordinary interior words are left at zero. This does not model their
many small, word-specific residual activations.
